# valid/carrier-cause-secondary-roots
profile own
scope.begin carrier_owner
scope.begin s
new a A
new b B
failure cause typed Cause
scope.split s a cause_packet
carrier cause cause_packet carrier_owner
failure primary typed Body
failure.cause primary cause
scope.split s b primary_packet
carrier primary primary_packet carrier_owner
failure secondary typed Secondary
failure.secondary primary secondary
gc a b
scope.unwind s primary
assert.failure Body Secondary
catch Body caught
failure.view view caught
use view
gc view
check ''
scope.end carrier_owner
